| Change | Details |
|--------|---------|
| No changes needed | `ChatProfileSelector` already handles emissions correctly from `Selector` |

Now when using modal mode (`useModal={true}`):
1. User clicks button to open modal
2. User selects/deselects profiles
3. User clicks "Done" → changes are emitted and modal closes
4. User clicks "✕" or backdrop → changes are reverted, modal closes without emitting
